# ============================================================================
#  Aphrody â€” .gitignore (refreshed 2026-05-16)
#  Polyglot: Rust nightly + C/C++ (MSVC) + Bun/TypeScript + Python tooling.
#  Order: most-frequent triggers first.
# ============================================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Rust / Cargo
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
target/
**/*.rs.bk
**/*.orig
**/Cargo.lock.tmp
# NOTE: Cargo.lock IS tracked (lockfile-only supply chain since 2026-05-16).
# NOTE: supply-chain/imports.lock IS tracked (cargo-vet feed pins).

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Bun / Node / npm  (node is FORBIDDEN â€” only bun.lock is committed)
