# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 13. External clones / vendored research mirrors
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
shared/git/
opt/
# NOTE: opt/* contains git submodules (magika, markitdown, material-design-icons,
# material-web, terminal) declared in .gitmodules.
# NOTE: vendor/* and packages/* are KEPT in the repo to preserve every
# source file (Rust, TS, Zig, Python) — even forks with local patches.
# Only Electron binaries (downloadable from upstream releases) are excluded.
vendor/electron-prebuilt/
packages/electron-prebuilt/
# Heavy upstream icon clone (re-cloned on demand — see packages/material-design-icons/README.md)
packages/material-design-icons/*
!packages/material-design-icons/README.md

